---
const cli = [
  ["ods status", "健康检查 + GPU 状态"],
  ["ods list", "所有服务及其状态"],
  ["ods logs llm", "跟踪日志（别名：llm、stt、tts）"],
  ["ods restart [service]", "重启一个或全部服务"],
  ["ods start / stop", "启动或停止技术栈"],
  ["ods mode cloud", "通过 LiteLLM 切换到云端 API"],
  ["ods mode local / hybrid", "本地推理 / 本地为主、云端兜底"],
  ["ods model swap T3", "切换到不同的硬件层级"],
  ["ods enable n8n", "启用一个扩展"],
  ["ods config show", "查看 .env（密钥已遮蔽）"],
  ["ods preset save / load", "快照并恢复当前配置"],
];
---

<section id="extend" class="relative border-b border-line">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-350 px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="reveal eyebrow">Extensible</p>
      <h2
        class="reveal mt-5 font-display text-[clamp(2rem,4.2vw,3.4rem)] font-bold leading-[1.15] tracking-tight"
      >
        ODS 的设计，
        <span class="text-amber">就是用来魔改的</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="reveal mt-6 text-[16px] leading-loose text-muted">
        每个服务都是一个扩展——一个带有
        <code class="rounded bg-base-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-ink">manifest.yaml</code>
        与
        <code class="rounded bg-base-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-ink">compose.yaml</code>
        的文件夹。控制台、CLI、健康检查与 compose 技术栈都会自动发现这些扩展。
        安装器本身也是模块化的——41 个库模块、一个共享的服务注册表，以及 14 个有序的阶段文件。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-14">
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="panel noise overflow-hidden shadow-[0_20px_50px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-line bg-base-950/70 px-5 py-3.5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#ef4444]/70"></span>
                <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#eab308]/70"></span>
                <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#22c55e]/70"></span>
              </div>
              <span class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.16em] text-faint ml-2">extensions/services/</span>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-faint">YAML / Compose</span>
          </div>
          <pre
            class="overflow-x-auto px-5 py-5 font-mono text-[12.5px] leading-loose text-ink/90 bg-base-950/50"
          >extensions/services/
  my-service/
    manifest.yaml      <span class="text-faint"># 元数据：名称、端口、健康端点、GPU 后端</span>
    compose.yaml       <span class="text-faint"># Docker Compose 片段（自动合并进技术栈）</span>

<span class="text-amber font-bold">$ </span>ods enable my-service     <span class="text-faint"># 启用它</span>
<span class="text-amber font-bold">$ </span>ods disable my-service    <span class="text-faint"># 禁用它</span>
<span class="text-amber font-bold">$ </span>ods list                  <span class="text-faint"># 查看全部</span></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/Osmantic/ODS/blob/main/ods/docs/EXTENSIONS.md"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn-tactile group gap-2 rounded-full border border-line bg-base-900/60 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink shadow-sm hover:border-amber/50 hover:text-amber"
          >
            <span>完整扩展指南</span>
            <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-faint transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:text-amber" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line>
              <polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/Osmantic/ODS/blob/main/ods/docs/INSTALLER-ARCHITECTURE.md"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn-tactile group gap-2 rounded-full border border-line bg-base-900/60 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink shadow-sm hover:border-amber/50 hover:text-amber"
          >
            <span>安装器架构</span>
            <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-faint transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:text-amber" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line>
              <polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal panel noise p-6 sm:p-7">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-line pb-4">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">ods-cli 命令大全</h3>
          <span class="rounded-full bg-base-950/80 px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] text-amber border border-line">
            11 条常用管理指令
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted">
          <code class="rounded bg-base-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-amber">ods</code>
          CLI 集中管理你的整个本地 AI 技术栈生命周期：
        </p>
        <dl class="mt-5 divide-y divide-line/60">
          {
            cli.map(([cmd, desc]) => (
              <div class="group grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 py-3 transition-colors duration-150 sm:grid-cols-[13rem_1fr] sm:gap-4 hover:bg-base-950/40 rounded-lg px-2 -mx-2">
                <dt class="font-mono text-[12.5px] font-medium text-ink transition-colors duration-150 group-hover:text-amber">
                  {cmd}
                </dt>
                <dd class="text-[13px] leading-[1.8] text-muted">{desc}</dd>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
